NOTE ON ARTWORK AND BRANDING

This licence covers the source code only.

The island map, the three aircraft sprites, and the Vacation Tracker name and
logo are property of Vacation Tracker and are NOT covered by the MIT licence
above. They are included so the game runs as shipped. If you fork or
redistribute this project, replace them with your own artwork and branding.

See the "Make it your own" section of README.md — the game is built to be
re-skinned, and works with any map and sprites in the right shape.
